      <title>金库里的硅基革命：中国国有大行的“AI大进军”</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/article-20260409231007998-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 09 Apr 2026 23:10:07 +0800</pubDate>
